# Security

- Never hardcode secrets; use env vars and document keys in `.env.example` only.
- Validate untrusted input at boundaries.
- Avoid XSS: do not inject unsanitized HTML.
- Do not weaken auth, CORS, or CSP without an explicit request.
- Dependency adds: prefer maintained packages; avoid abandoned MCP/npm packages.
